The dish looks like eggplant parmigiana, with tomato sauce, melted cheese, and eggplant slices, plus what may be a zucchini slice. The plate is white and probably about 22-24 cm across. The food covers roughly 10 x 9 cm, in a pile a couple of centimeters thick.

That works out to about 150-200 g of food. Eggplant parmigiana runs roughly 150 kcal per 100 g, so about 180 g comes to around 270 kcal.

